<title>POLAND: TABLE-HANDLOWY, FUNDS UNDERWRITE POLAR.</title>
<headline>TABLE-HANDLOWY, FUNDS UNDERWRITE POLAR.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				    White goods maker Polar SA</p>
<p> Total Issue Size (No of Shares):   5,400,000</p>
<p> Issue Type:				new common shares</p>
<p> Price (PLN):			     11</p>
<p> Underwriter:				SHARES	  STAND-BY FEE</p>
<p>						 UNDERWRITTEN  (PCT)</p>
<p>Bank Handlowy Capital Markets Centre  1,200,000	 2.5</p>
<p>Polish Private Equity Fund I	    1,100,000	 2.5</p>
<p>Polish Private Equity Fund II	   1,100,000	 2.5</p>
<p>Polish Enterprise Fund		    1,100,000	 2.5</p>
<p>NOTE: The remaining 900,000 shares earmarked for the company's employees will not be underwritten.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
